    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE TABLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Here the simplicity of rules is combined with the depth of strategy. No pay-to-win mechanics here \u2014 only your skills and luck decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496490/extras/77f48d89b8d158eddc4de149cd49cfb1.poster.avif?t=1744018221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496490/extras/77f48d89b8d158eddc4de149cd49cfb1.webm?t=1744018221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY AS YOU FEEL</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duel with Friends: Compete in private matches and prove who is the best strategist!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matchmaking: Play with other players around the world, increase your rank and raise up the leaderboard. Show the ring on your hand and everyone will immediately realize who they are dealing with.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing with a bot: Want to practice or just have a good time? We can always find you a companion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496490/extras/6eb85e446119cc558a15e8d684d0b028.poster.avif?t=1744018221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496490/extras/6eb85e446119cc558a15e8d684d0b028.webm?t=1744018221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GESTURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not just a mechanic, but a way to express emotions and interact with your opponent. Show hand gestures of victory, surprise or support, and use paired hand hand motions to create unique moments during a duel. Your hand is your expression in the game!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496490/extras/3a06d6ba7a25be1bb487e4d39c421227.poster.avif?t=1744018221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496490/extras/3a06d6ba7a25be1bb487e4d39c421227.webm?t=1744018221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will make the gameplay unique: change the looks of your hand, dice, plate, health stones, tokens and totems. Changing the environment will take you to different time ages \u2014 from a regular tavern to futuristic worlds. And yes, your opponent will see it too!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496490/extras/6824d583686c45cbdba05247d66b3e35.poster.avif?t=1744018221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496490/extras/6824d583686c45cbdba05247d66b3e35.webm?t=1744018221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROLL THE DICE\u00a0\u2014 LET LUCK DECIDE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your personality with hand gestures, surprise your opponents with unusual tactics and enjoy the moments when victory depends on a single roll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE TABLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Here the simplicity of rules is combined with the depth of strategy. No pay-to-win mechanics here \u2014 only your skills and luck decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496490/extras/77f48d89b8d158eddc4de149cd49cfb1.poster.avif?t=1744018221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496490/extras/77f48d89b8d158eddc4de149cd49cfb1.webm?t=1744018221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY AS YOU FEEL</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duel with Friends: Compete in private matches and prove who is the best strategist!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matchmaking: Play with other players around the world, increase your rank and raise up the leaderboard. Show the ring on your hand and everyone will immediately realize who they are dealing with.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing with a bot: Want to practice or just have a good time? We can always find you a companion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496490/extras/6eb85e446119cc558a15e8d684d0b028.poster.avif?t=1744018221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496490/extras/6eb85e446119cc558a15e8d684d0b028.webm?t=1744018221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GESTURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not just a mechanic, but a way to express emotions and interact with your opponent. Show hand gestures of victory, surprise or support, and use paired hand hand motions to create unique moments during a duel. Your hand is your expression in the game!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496490/extras/3a06d6ba7a25be1bb487e4d39c421227.poster.avif?t=1744018221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496490/extras/3a06d6ba7a25be1bb487e4d39c421227.webm?t=1744018221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will make the gameplay unique: change the looks of your hand, dice, plate, health stones, tokens and totems. Changing the environment will take you to different time ages \u2014 from a regular tavern to futuristic worlds. And yes, your opponent will see it too!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496490/extras/6824d583686c45cbdba05247d66b3e35.poster.avif?t=1744018221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496490/extras/6824d583686c45cbdba05247d66b3e35.webm?t=1744018221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROLL THE DICE\u00a0\u2014 LET LUCK DECIDE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your personality with hand gestures, surprise your opponents with unusual tactics and enjoy the moments when victory depends on a single roll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "Hexadale is a comfortable board duel where every dice roll, every use of totem brings you closer to victory, and the variety of eras makes the game cozy and atmospheric. A simple but addictive game for two!",
